!Misareaux Coast-map.jpg|right|Misareaux Coast
* Head toward the **Palace** in {z:Ru'Lude Gardens} for a cutscene.
* Talk to Pherimociel at (G-6).
* Travel to (I-11) in {z:Misareaux Coast} and check the **Dilapidated Gate** to spawn 3 {p:Detector-type|Category:Detector} NMs.
** Take the lower western exit from {z:Tavnazian Safehold}.
* Checking the __Dilapidated Gate__ will spawn {m:Warder Thalia}, {m:Warder Aglaia}, and {m:Warder Euphrosyne}.
** The NM's can be slept and defeated individually although they begin to resist {s:Sleep} after a time. All three must be defeated to progress.

* After you defeat the Warders, check the **Dilapidated Gate** again for a cutscene.

